":"Debate Forum","gloss":[["balance","equilibrar"],["justify","justificar"],["deserve","merecer"],["candid","franco"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Few speakers deserve unqualified praise.","ans":"T","why":"Seldom does a speaker deserve."},{"q":"The note says evasive answers are inevitable.","ans":"F","why":"fewer answers would have been evasive."},{"q":"A candid admission builds credibility.","ans":"T","why":"builds credibility."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“far from hurting” means…","opts":["em vez de prejudicar","longe de machucar","prejudicando"],"ans":0,"why":"far from + -ing."},{"q":"“seldom” = ?","opts":["raramente","frequentemente","nunca"],"ans":0,"why":"seldom."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Grammar recap","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verifique","Exemplo"],"rows":[["Uso **inversão estilística**?","**Seldom does** a speaker…; **Had** the candidates…"],["Faço **resenha** com veredito?","**On points**, X wins"],["Escrevo **desculpas** públicas?","I **take full responsibility**"],["Uso **have** em seus sentidos?","**have** it done; **had trouble** finding"],["Refuto com método?","state · label · explain · replace"]],"cap":"Autoavaliação da Unidade 7 (C2)"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice · Mixed review","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences (from the unit)","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"The author gives short ___ to grassroots speakers. (shrift)","a":"shrift","why":"expressão."},{"s":"We gather not to praise a title, ___ to remember a man. (but)","a":"but","why":"contraste."},{"s":"The council ___ the report translated. (have, presente)","a":"has","why":"causativo."},{"s":"___ on discourse analysis, the study examines speeches. (drawing)","a":"Drawing","why":"particípio."},{"s":"Lead ___ the news. (with)","a":"with","why":"phrasal."},{"s":"What ___ me is that endurance became the argument. (strike)","a":"strikes","why":"p